    "section": "02. Datasheets",
    "ruleNumber": "02.06",
    "summary": "This field specifies the unit’s model types and their counts. It lists a set of default kit for each model and additional rules, including eligible attachments for leaders and permitted transport passengers. A bearer is the model carrying the specific weapon, enhancement, or other kit named by a rule. A reference to the unit’s equipment includes the weapons and kit on any model in that unit.",
